    "domainId": "enterprise-applications-and-financial-systems",
    "domainName": "Enterprise Applications and Financial Systems",
    "companyProfile": "Booking Holdings (NASDAQ: BKNG) operates Booking.com, Priceline, Agoda, KAYAK and OpenTable. FY2025: revenue $26.9bn, gross bookings $186.1bn, 70% of gross bookings on a merchant basis, about 24,300 employees. Booking Holdings Financial Services operates licensed e-money institutions supporting the brands' payment products. Booking.com's Financial Systems team runs SAP on HANA (Simple Finance since 2016, S/4HANA journey with Central Finance since 2019).",
    "operatingModel": "Modeled: a central architecture team under the Senior Director Architecture, Enterprise Applications and Financial Systems sets standards, owns decision rights on mandatory global architecture standards and the target state, and leads the brand finance engineering teams through a matrix (they report into their brands). Platform and stream-aligned finance-systems teams build on one global finance core. Team names and headcounts (132 people: 14 teams plus 9 group leads in 6 groups) are illustrative, not Booking Holdings' actual structure; finance operations staff, brand engineering teams and the payments platform are outside the team model."
